    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<section class="markdown-section"><h1 id="目前学习进度为0捏">目前学习进度为0捏…<a class="anchor" href="http://tlkier.github.io/posts/%E7%94%B5%E6%BA%90%E5%8D%8F%E4%BC%9A%E8%80%83%E6%A0%B8%E5%B7%A8%E7%B4%A7%E6%97%A0%E6%AF%94/#%E7%9B%AE%E5%89%8D%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E8%BF%9B%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%BA0%E6%8D%8F"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore>#</span></a></h1><p>最近课余时间光顾着玩游戏了(我还把生化危机4和刺客信条2通关了)</p><hr /><p>这是今天电源协会负责人开的会议部分内容
我说实在的 你和我说那么多我完全不懂的宏观上的知识我也听不懂啊
入学的时候我听说考核是在十月底，就一直把学习计划延后 怎么现在截止时间变成月中了
加油吧 只能赶工学一下看一下能不能进去吧</p><div class="image-grid" data-columns="4" style="--image-grid-columns:4;--image-grid-aspect-ratio:16 / 10;--image-grid-fit:cover"><figure class="image-grid__item"><a class="image-grid__link no-styling" href="http://tlkier.github.io/images/%E7%94%B5%E6%BA%90%E5%8D%8F%E4%BC%9A%E8%80%83%E6%A0%B8%EF%BC%8C%E5%B7%A8%E7%B4%A7%E6%97%A0%E6%AF%94/2.jpg" data-fancybox="image-grid-0" data-no-swup="true" data-caption="会议部分内容1"><img src="http://tlkier.github.io/images/%E7%94%B5%E6%BA%90%E5%8D%8F%E4%BC%9A%E8%80%83%E6%A0%B8%EF%BC%8C%E5%B7%A8%E7%B4%A7%E6%97%A0%E6%AF%94/2.jpg" alt="会议部分内容1" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a><figcaption class="image-grid__caption">会议部分内容1</figcaption></figure><figure class="image-grid__item"><a class="image-grid__link no-styling" href="http://tlkier.github.io/images/%E7%94%B5%E6%BA%90%E5%8D%8F%E4%BC%9A%E8%80%83%E6%A0%B8%EF%BC%8C%E5%B7%A8%E7%B4%A7%E6%97%A0%E6%AF%94/3.jpg" data-fancybox="image-grid-0" data-no-swup="true" data-caption="会议部分内容2"><img src="http://tlkier.github.io/images/%E7%94%B5%E6%BA%90%E5%8D%8F%E4%BC%9A%E8%80%83%E6%A0%B8%EF%BC%8C%E5%B7%A8%E7%B4%A7%E6%97%A0%E6%AF%94/3.jpg" alt="会议部分内容2" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a><figcaption class="image-grid__caption">会议部分内容2</figcaption></figure><figure class="image-grid__item"><a class="image-grid__link no-styling" href="http://tlkier.github.io/images/%E7%94%B5%E6%BA%90%E5%8D%8F%E4%BC%9A%E8%80%83%E6%A0%B8%EF%BC%8C%E5%B7%A8%E7%B4%A7%E6%97%A0%E6%AF%94/4.jpg" data-fancybox="image-grid-0" data-no-swup="true" data-caption="会议部分内容3"><img src="http://tlkier.github.io/images/%E7%94%B5%E6%BA%90%E5%8D%8F%E4%BC%9A%E8%80%83%E6%A0%B8%EF%BC%8C%E5%B7%A8%E7%B4%A7%E6%97%A0%E6%AF%94/4.jpg" alt="会议部分内容3" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a><figcaption class="image-grid__caption">会议部分内容3</figcaption></figure><figure class="image-grid__item"><a class="image-grid__link no-styling" href="http://tlkier.github.io/images/%E7%94%B5%E6%BA%90%E5%8D%8F%E4%BC%9A%E8%80%83%E6%A0%B8%EF%BC%8C%E5%